OL,3,AThird Heathrow runway should only go
OL,4,Aahead if airlines pay for cleaner
OL,5,Aflying, say advisers
OL,6,
OL,7,FHeathrow's third runway cannot be
OL,8,Fapproved without changes to current
OL,9,Fclimate policies, the government's
OL,10,Fadvisers have said.
OL,12,FThe Climate Change Committee (CCC) said
OL,13,Fexpansion can still go ahead but only
OL,14,Fif the aviation industry funds cleaner
OL,15,Ffuels and pays for machines that suck
OL,16,Fcarbon dioxide out of the air.
OL,18,FMaking the industry pay could push up
OL,19,Fthe cost of flying with a return trip
OL,20,Fto Alicante costing around #150 more by
OL,21,F2050, and a return to New York up #400
OL,22,Fin today's prices, it said.
